# Experimental output. `results/` is a local, regenerable scratch tree that is never
# committed: every result file records in its manifest the commit and the cluster
# snapshot that produced it, so a run can be reproduced without storing its artifacts.
# Raw shards can be large (the sufficiency campaign alone is 115 MB); the summary JSONs
# the investigation scripts write are also left untracked, not kept in the repo.
results/

